{
  "header": ["The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, at most 5 minutes with every timeout counted,",
             "for when a longer play than the regular one (tools/play_plan.json) is needed: the launcher, Load ROM on a new profile",
             "once the shader list Chrome builds behind the launcher is done (Firefox builds none there, and its line saying so is",
             "the one waited for), Start Game and the logos; then four stages in one load, each behind a need that fails the run",
             "unless g_StageNum is that stage and the menu MENU_RUN_STAGE, its opening flyover skipped with A (until g_CameraMode is",
             "Bond's own view). Dam is started by tools/shader_survey.js as mission select does (MENU_RUN_STAGE behind the stage's",
             "briefing): about 35 s of Bond on foot, walking down the road and back, turning, strafing and firing. Then Facility",
             "(indoors, from the vent), Surface 1 (snow) and Frigate (the dock and the ship), each started from inside the stage",
             "before by the survey's nextStage (the stage's briefing, then g_MainStageNum, which ends the stage loop as a stage's",
             "end does, with no report between): about 25 s of Bond walking out and back by as much about where it starts him,",
             "strafing, firing and turning. Its waits and holds are on the game's own clock, g_GlobalTimer (60ths of a second), so",
             "every browser walks Bond as far whatever frames it gives the game. Bond is made invincible once each stage has started",
             "(setInvincible): a stage started that way crashes when it ends (patches/shader_survey.c), and Dam played long enough",
             "for the guards to kill him did, the Mission Failed screen loading a briefing mission select never set up."],
